{"contract":"bw-jmdict-shard/3","entries":[{"accent":0,"common":true,"etymology":[],"examples":[{"en":"He declined the job-offer very politely.","ja":"彼は就職を丁重に断った。","ref":"299299_104392","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"His attitude is by no means polite.","ja":"彼の態度は決して丁重ではない。","ref":"287104_116565","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"What is hard to put up with is his over-politeness.","ja":"がまんするのが難しいのは彼の度を超した丁重さである。","ref":"63573_226233","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"She did me the courtesy of answering my letter.","ja":"彼女は丁重にも私の手紙に返事をくれた。","ref":"315825_87882","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"She bowed to me with courtesy when she saw me.","ja":"彼女は私を見ると、丁重におじぎをした。","ref":"314439_89267","source":"tanaka"}],"forms":["丁重","鄭重"],"glosses":["polite","courteous","hospitable"],"id":"1427290","lemma":"丁重","pos":["adj-na","n"],"readingKata":"テイチョウ","readings":["ていちょう"],"sourceUrls":["https://zh.wiktionary.org/wiki/丁重#Japanese","https://kaikki.org/zhwiktionary/All%20languages%20combined/meaning/丁/丁重/丁重.html"],"synonyms":[],"zhGlosses":["丁重【ていちょう】 名·形动 郑重，彬彬有礼。 彼の言葉づかいは丁重だ 他言词彬彬有礼。"],"zhSenses":[{"examples":[],"glosses":["丁重【ていちょう】 名·形动 郑重，彬彬有礼。 彼の言葉づかいは丁重だ 他言词彬彬有礼。"],"pos":""}]},{"accent":3,"common":true,"etymology":["源自上古日語。首次見於公元720年的《日本書紀》。"],"examples":[{"en":"He behaved in a cheap manner.","ja":"彼は卑しい振舞いをした。","ref":"302486_101211","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"Whatever is worth doing at all, is worth doing well.","ja":"卑しくも価値あるものには立派にやる価値がある。","ref":"25336_121161","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"He is above all meanness.","ja":"卑しいことは絶対にしない。","ref":"282844_121162","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"His pride wouldn't allow him to do such a mean thing.","ja":"誇りがあるから、彼はそんなに卑しい事は出来ない。","ref":"240011_174458","source":"tanaka"}],"forms":["卑しい","賤しい","鄙しい"],"glosses":["lowborn","humble","lowly","vulgar","coarse","crude","mean","base","vile","despicable","dirty","unfair","shabby","poor-looking","greedy","gluttonous","avaricious"],"id":"1482660","lemma":"卑しい","pos":["adj-i"],"readingKata":"イヤシイ","readings":["いやしい"],"